---
import SiteLayout from '../../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import { company } from '../../data/site';
---

<SiteLayout title="Privacy Policy | YIC Inflatable Sports" description="How YIC Inflatable Sports handles contact, quotation, and website enquiry information from global B2B buyers.">
  <section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy</div><p class="eyebrow">Buyer information</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Clear information about the details shared with YIC when you request a quotation or contact the factory.</p></div></section>
  <section class="section legal-page"><div class="container legal-content">
    <h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>When you contact YIC, you may provide your name, company, email address, country, product requirements, artwork, destination, and delivery information. We use these details to answer your enquiry, prepare a quotation, discuss production, and coordinate follow-up communication.</p>
    <h2>How enquiries are handled</h2><p>Enquiries may be sent to YIC by email, WhatsApp, or the configured website form endpoint. Confirmed website form submissions are recorded in YIC's internal enquiry register and sent to the responsible sales contact. We do not sell enquiry information. Information is shared internally only with people who need it to respond, quote, manufacture, or coordinate delivery.</p>
    <h2>Website analytics and links</h2><p>This static website records page views, WhatsApp button clicks, and confirmed form submissions to understand how buyers use the site and respond to enquiries. Page-view and WhatsApp-click records contain page and source information plus an anonymous session identifier; they do not store visitor IP addresses or WhatsApp message content. Links to WhatsApp, Google Maps, social networks, and other third-party services are governed by those services' own policies. Do not send confidential payment details through the website enquiry form.</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2><p>For a privacy question, contact <a href={`mailto:${company.email}`}>{company.email}</a> and identify the enquiry or information you are asking about.</p>
  </div></section>
</SiteLayout>
